00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:03.160
evals stored in the
test-release-evals.py file,

92
00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:06.889
along with the previous files
we had, the test assistant,

93
00:06:06.889 --> 00:06:10.240
and the app where we
stored our original code.

94
00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:13.160
We're gonna push all of
that to GitHub. And then,

95
00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:17.720
to CircleCI so that we can
evaluate our application

96
00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:20.980
including the model-graded evals.

97
00:06:21.439 --> 00:06:23.000
Now, in this particular case,

98
00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:26.110
we are using the full
evaluation for the positive case,

99
00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:30.459
but intentionally passing the known bad
